---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<Base
  title="Email API — EmailFlare"
  description="A REST email sending API built on Cloudflare Email Sending. Scoped API keys, React Email templates, domain management, send history, and a full admin UI — ready in minutes."
  keywords="emailflare email api, cloudflare email sending api, transactional email cloudflare, react email templates, self-hosted email api, open source email api"
  canonical="https://emailflare.dev/email-api"
  ogUrl="https://emailflare.dev/email-api"
  navType="docs"
  navTitle="Email API"
>

<style is:global>
  /* ── EA HERO ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ea-hero {
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem) 0 clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .ea-hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 70% at 18% 50%, oklch(93% 0.06 58 / 0.35) 0%, transparent 65%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .ea-hero-content { max-width: 640px; }
  .ea-hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    background: var(--orange-light); color: var(--orange-hover);
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;
    padding: 4px 13px; border-radius: 100px;
    border: 1px solid var(--orange-mid);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .ea-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em; margin-bottom: 18px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .ea-hero h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--orange); }
  .ea-hero-sub {
    font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 500px; margin: 0 0 32px; line-height: 1.72;
  }

  /* ── API SECTION ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .api-section {
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .api-wrap {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .api-wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .api-features { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .api-features li { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .api-features .check { color: var(--orange); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 3px; }
  .api-features li .line { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }
  .api-features li strong { display: block; color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  .code-window {
    background: var(--bg-dark); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 48px oklch(0% 0 0 / 0.16), 0 0 0 1px oklch(100% 0 0 / 0.05);
  }
  .code-window-bar { background: var(--bg-dark-2); padding: 10px 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
  .terminal-title { margin-left: auto; font-size: 11px; color: oklch(42% 0.01 58); font-family: var(--font-mono); }
  .code-window-body { padding: 20px 22px 22px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.75; }
  .c-method { color: oklch(72% 0.14 230); font-weight: 600; }
  .c-path   { color: oklch(78% 0.10 80); }
  .c-header { color: oklch(64% 0.01 58); }
  .c-key    { color: oklch(72% 0.14 230); }
  .c-str    { color: oklch(74% 0.12 85); }
  .c-punct  { color: oklch(56% 0.01 58); }
  .c-cmt    { color: oklch(44% 0.01 58); font-style: italic; }

  /* ── WHY SECTION ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .why-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
  .why-card {
    background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 26px 26px 22px; transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .why-card:hover { border-color: var(--orange-mid); }
  .why-card .card-icon { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 14px; display: block; }
  .why-card h3 { font-size: 0.975rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.35; }
  .why-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* ── VS SECTION ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .vs-section { background: var(--bg-alt); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .vs-split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) { .vs-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .vs-card { border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .vs-card-header { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 20px 24px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .vs-card-cf .vs-card-header { background: oklch(95% 0.005 230); border-bottom-color: oklch(88% 0.01 230); }
  .vs-card-ef .vs-card-header { background: var(--orange-light); border-bottom-color: var(--orange-mid); }
  .vs-card-cf { background: var(--bg-card); }
  .vs-card-ef { background: oklch(99.5% 0.015 55); }
  .vs-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .vs-card-cf .vs-title { color: oklch(35% 0.02 230); }
  .vs-card-ef .vs-title { color: var(--orange-hover); }
  .vs-subtitle { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-faint); }
  .vs-badge { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 99px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .vs-badge-cf { background: oklch(89% 0.01 230); color: oklch(40% 0.02 230); border: 1px solid oklch(82% 0.015 230); }
  .vs-badge-ef { background: var(--orange); color: #fff; }
  .vs-rows { padding: 6px 0; }
  .vs-row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .vs-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .vs-card-cf .vs-row:hover { background: oklch(97.5% 0.005 230); }
  .vs-card-ef .vs-row:hover { background: oklch(98.5% 0.018 55); }
  .vs-header-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .vs-icon { flex-shrink: 0; width: 18px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .vs-card-cf .vs-icon { color: oklch(54% 0.16 24); }
  .vs-card-ef .vs-icon { color: oklch(50% 0.18 150); }
  .vs-row-label { color: var(--text); }
  .vs-row code { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11.5px; background: oklch(93% 0.01 55); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; color: var(--text); }

  /* ── FEATURES GRID ────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .features-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
  @media (max-width: 1100px) { .features-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 700px)  { .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 480px)  { .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .feature-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 18px 18px 16px; transition: border-color 0.15s; }
  .feature-card:hover { border-color: var(--border-strong); }
  .feature-card .card-icon { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 9px; background: var(--orange-light); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .feature-card .card-icon svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--orange-hover); }
  .feature-card h3 { font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 7px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .feature-card p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; }
  .feature-card p code { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11.5px; background: oklch(93% 0.006 60); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; color: var(--text); }
  .feature-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--orange-hover); background: var(--orange-light); border: 1px solid var(--orange-mid); border-radius: 100px; padding: 2px 9px; margin-top: 12px; }

  /* ── LAYOUTS SHOWCASE ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ea-layouts-section { background: var(--bg-alt); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .layouts-scroll { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 32px; }
  .layout-chip {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 100px; padding: 6px 14px; font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 450; transition: border-color 0.15s, color 0.15s;
  }
  .layout-chip::before { content: ''; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--orange-mid); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .layout-chip:hover { border-color: var(--orange-mid); color: var(--orange-hover); }

  /* ── DEPLOY SECTION ───────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ea-deploy-section { background: var(--bg-dark); color: oklch(88% 0.01 58); }
  .ea-deploy-section .section-eyebrow { color: var(--orange); }
  .ea-deploy-section .section-title { color: oklch(95% 0.008 58); }
  .ea-deploy-section .section-sub { color: oklch(60% 0.01 58); }
  .deploy-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; margin-top: 48px; }
  @media (max-width: 780px) { .deploy-options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .deploy-option {
    background: var(--bg-dark-2); border: 1px solid oklch(26% 0.012 48);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .do-header { padding: 24px 28px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid oklch(20% 0.012 48); }
  .do-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 99px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .do-badge-docker { background: oklch(22% 0.04 230 / 0.5); color: oklch(68% 0.12 230); border: 1px solid oklch(34% 0.08 230 / 0.5); }
  .do-badge-worker { background: oklch(22% 0.06 48 / 0.5); color: var(--orange); border: 1px solid oklch(34% 0.10 48 / 0.5); }
  .do-title { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: oklch(93% 0.01 58); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .do-sub { font-size: 0.875rem; color: oklch(56% 0.01 58); line-height: 1.6; }
  .do-steps { padding: 20px 28px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .do-step { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .do-step-num { flex-shrink: 0; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid oklch(30% 0.012 48); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: oklch(44% 0.01 58); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-top: 2px; }
  .do-step-label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: oklch(84% 0.01 58); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .do-step-desc { font-size: 12.5px; color: oklch(52% 0.01 58); line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .do-footer { padding: 16px 28px; border-top: 1px solid oklch(20% 0.012 48); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
  .do-footer-note { font-size: 12px; color: oklch(44% 0.01 58); }
  .do-footer a { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
  .do-footer-docker a { color: oklch(62% 0.12 230); }
  .do-footer-worker a { color: var(--orange); }
  .code-block { background: oklch(10% 0.012 48); border: 1px solid oklch(22% 0.012 48); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.75; overflow-x: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
  .cb-kw  { color: oklch(72% 0.14 165); }
  .cb-val { color: oklch(74% 0.12 82); }
  .cb-cmt { color: oklch(42% 0.01 58); font-style: italic; }
  .cb-cmd { color: oklch(80% 0.12 48); }
  .cb-url { color: var(--orange); }
  .deploy-extras { margin-top: 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .deploy-extra { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; background: oklch(16% 0.012 48); border: 1px solid oklch(24% 0.012 48); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 18px; text-decoration: none; transition: border-color 0.15s; }
  .deploy-extra:hover { border-color: oklch(38% 0.02 48); }
  .de-icon { font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .de-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: oklch(84% 0.01 58); margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .de-sub   { font-size: 12px; color: oklch(48% 0.01 58); }
  .de-arrow { margin-left: auto; color: oklch(40% 0.01 58); font-size: 13px; }
</style>

  <!-- PRODUCT SUB-NAV -->
  <nav class="product-subnav email-product-subnav">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="psn-inner">
        <a href="#overview" class="psn-link active">Overview</a>
        <a href="#templates" class="psn-link">Templates</a>
        <a href="#deploy" class="psn-link">Deploy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section id="overview" class="ea-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ea-hero-content">
        <div class="ea-hero-badge">
          <Icon name="lucide:send" size={12} /> Email API
        </div>
        <h1>Transactional email<br /><em>on Cloudflare.</em></h1>
        <p class="ea-hero-sub">
          A clean REST API built on Cloudflare Email Sending. Scoped keys, React Email
          templates, domain management, send history, and a full admin UI — ready in minutes.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#deploy">Deploy →</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/docs">API reference →</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#templates">50 templates →</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/0xdps/emailflare" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- API SNIPPET -->
  <section class="api-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="api-wrap">
        <div>
          <div class="section-eyebrow">Simple by design</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">One endpoint.<br />Infinite flexibility.</h2>
          <p class="section-sub">
            Send an email with a single HTTP request. Reference a stored template, pass
            variables, and EmailFlare handles rendering, delivery, and logging.
          </p>
          <ul class="api-features">
            <li>
              <span class="check">✓</span>
              <div class="line">
                <strong>Bearer token auth</strong>
                Scoped API keys — not your master Cloudflare token. Prefix <code>eflive_</code> for live sends, <code>eftest_</code> to capture into the test mailbox instead.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="check">✓</span>
              <div class="line">
                <strong>Template or raw send</strong>
                Pass <code>templateSlug</code> / <code>templateId</code> with variables, or send raw <code>html</code> / <code>text</code> directly. Optional <code>fromName</code> and <code>replyTo</code> fields.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="check">✓</span>
              <div class="line">
                <strong>Multi-recipient batch</strong>
                <code>"to"</code> accepts a single address or an array of up to 50. Duplicates are deduplicated automatically.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="check">✓</span>
              <div class="line">
                <strong>Idempotency-Key support</strong>
                Pass an <code>Idempotency-Key</code> header to prevent duplicate sends on network retries — cached result returned on repeat.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="check">✓</span>
              <div class="line">
                <strong>Rate-limit headers on every response</strong>
                100 requests/min per key. <code>X-RateLimit-Limit</code>, <code>X-RateLimit-Remaining</code>, and <code>X-RateLimit-Reset</code> included.
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div style="margin-top:18px;">
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/docs#api-send">See full API reference →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="code-window">
          <div class="code-window-bar">
            <div class="t-dot t-red"></div>
            <div class="t-dot t-yellow"></div>
            <div class="t-dot t-green"></div>
            <span class="terminal-title">POST /v1/send</span>
          </div>
          <div class="code-window-body">
            <div><span class="c-method">POST</span> <span class="c-path">/v1/send</span></div>
            <div><span class="c-header">Authorization:</span> <span class="c-str">Bearer eflive_xxxxxxxxxxxx</span></div>
            <div><span class="c-header">Content-Type:</span> <span class="c-str">application/json</span></div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px;"><span class="c-punct">&#123;</span></div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="c-key">"to"</span><span class="c-punct">:</span>           <span class="c-str">"alex@example.com"</span><span class="c-punct">,</span></div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="c-key">"from"</span><span class="c-punct">:</span>         <span class="c-str">"hello@yourdomain.com"</span><span class="c-punct">,</span></div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="c-key">"fromName"</span><span class="c-punct">:</span>     <span class="c-str">"Acme"</span><span class="c-punct">,</span></div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="c-key">"templateSlug"</span><span class="c-punct">:</span> <span class="c-str">"welcome"</span><span class="c-punct">,</span></div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="c-key">"themeId"</span><span class="c-punct">:</span>      <span class="c-str">"ocean"</span><span class="c-punct">,</span></div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="c-key">"variables"</span><span class="c-punct">:</span>    <span class="c-punct">&#123;</span></div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="c-key">"name"</span><span class="c-punct">:</span>     <span class="c-str">"Alex"</span><span class="c-punct">,</span></div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="c-key">"loginUrl"</span><span class="c-punct">:</span> <span class="c-str">"https://acme.com/login"</span></div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="c-punct">&#125;</span></div>
            <div><span class="c-punct">&#125;</span></div>
            <div style="margin-top:14px;"><span class="c-cmt">// 200 → &#123; results: [&#123; to, cfId &#125;] &#125;</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY EMAILFLARE -->
  <section id="why">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Why EmailFlare</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Everything Cloudflare Email Sending<br />should have shipped with.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">
          Cloudflare Email Sending is powerful infrastructure. EmailFlare gives it the API layer,
          UI, and tooling that makes it ready for production teams.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="card-icon"><Icon name="lucide:key-round" /></span>
          <h3>Scoped keys, not root credentials</h3>
          <p>Generate per-domain or multi-domain API keys from the dashboard. Your Cloudflare API token never leaves the server — application code only ever sees an EmailFlare key.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="card-icon"><Icon name="lucide:file-text" /></span>
          <h3>Templates you manage, not code you maintain</h3>
          <p>Store reusable HTML templates with <code style="font-size:12px;background:oklch(93% 0.006 60);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;">{"{{variable}}"}</code> interpolation, plain-text versions, and named React Email layouts. Send by template ID — not inline HTML strings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="card-icon"><Icon name="lucide:search" /></span>
          <h3>Full send history, zero blind spots</h3>
          <p>Every send is logged — recipient, sender, template used, API key, Cloudflare message ID, status, and error detail. Debug delivery without guessing which email was sent when.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="card-icon"><Icon name="lucide:globe" /></span>
          <h3>Domain management without the CLI</h3>
          <p>Provision Cloudflare sending subdomains, inspect DKIM and return-path DNS records, and verify domain status — all from the admin dashboard instead of juggling API calls.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="card-icon"><Icon name="lucide:shield-check" /></span>
          <h3>Rate limiting you didn't have to write</h3>
          <p>Per-key rate limiting is enforced at the API middleware layer. Rogue callers can't flood your Cloudflare quota. Limits and reset times are returned on every response.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="card-icon"><Icon name="lucide:package" /></span>
          <h3>One Worker, not an ops project</h3>
          <p>Backend, admin UI, and D1 SQLite storage are bundled in one Cloudflare Worker — no servers, no containers. A Docker image ships too for self-hosting: one volume, no Postgres, no Redis.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VS SECTION -->
  <section id="vs" class="vs-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Comparison</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">EmailFlare vs. raw Cloudflare API</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">
          Cloudflare Email Sending is solid infrastructure — but a low-level API.
          EmailFlare is the application layer on top.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="vs-split">
        <div class="vs-card vs-card-cf">
          <div class="vs-card-header">
            <div class="vs-header-brand">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="flex-shrink:0;">
